   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Honest Man** (1 other source): Introduced from stage as coming from a fictional 1987 first album called \"Biblical Prophecies\" [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **By My Car**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2002-03-20.aud.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 13 songs; 84 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Low Dog reported a great crowd of fanatics and some new fans; band played roughly 90 minutes [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2002-03-20.aud.flac16**: taped by George \"Low Dog\" S.; transferred by Magnix; source: AUD MD > CD-R [1]. Also: Taped source came via Low Dog, who traveled with the band; lineage is CD-R to EAC to FLAC level 8 [1]",
